{"overview":"A beautiful showgirl, name \"the Canary\" is a scheming nightclub singer. Blackmailing is her game and with that she ends up dead. But who killed \"the Canary\". All the suspects knew and were used by her and everyone had a motive to see her dead. The only witness to the crime has also been 'rubbed out'. Only one man, the keen, fascinating, debonair detective Philo Vance, would be able to figure out who is the killer.","tagline":"Who killed the most beautiful woman on Broadway?","cast":[{"n":"William Powell","c":"Philo Vance","p":"/8DTWs389THkVCTiDFu0x8ekNmUC.jpg","q":"Q105960"},{"n":"James Hall","c":"Jimmie Spottswoode","p":"/yL9p7uLhjhTyxYyRZV51ZUKUApc.jpg","q":"Q726409"},{"n":"Louise Brooks","c":"The Canary","p":"/xmOZV5S0dgyyRAfoSsnIEENLV2d.jpg","q":"Q152779"},{"n":"Jean Arthur","c":"Alice LaFosse","p":"/h46KhIQOOMPUMIdGNSN3A4zwcGQ.jpg","q":"Q229338"},{"n":"Charles Lane","c":"Charles Spottswoode","p":"/vpIxv89AjguuVgaXaHRTWYpALwD.jpg","q":"Q634150"},{"n":"Lawrence Grant","c":"John Cleaver","p":"/jDglJFaVazLaAMDq9hJyvsB1SXW.jpg","q":"Q1809184"},{"n":"Gustav von Seyffertitz","c":"Dr. Ambrose Lindquist","p":"/849KvertinEPsW09lOgXAza44F2.jpg","q":"Q73168"},{"n":"E.H. Calvert","c":"District Attorney Markham (as Captain E.","p":"/7FYUp62z6DR76sCEeUZHts9cDJW.jpg","q":"Q24541"},{"n":"Eugene Pallette","c":"Sergeant Heath","p":"/y3n1c9qjmJzGeZWihwm0QWlmDoR.jpg","q":"Q911472"},{"n":"Ned Sparks","c":"Tony Skeel","p":"/bRduH9CVoOKfD19dKmlxujvEe4Z.jpg","q":"Q539170"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Canary_Murder_Case_(film)","qid":"Q3520192","rel":{"US":{"d":"1929-02-16","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/aCyTYy4ypd9zAl8hgOaBlD1Sem9.jpg","/twKPiES0qIdELU5GSuq7GmXM4AJ.jpg","/pwqPW9CWaUVBorfBneGIEP7hwol.jpg","/vEL23ed3f9XoLymOpqtRiUbNkii.jpg","/kgyATSZBnddfs62nA57aWNZvBA9.jpg","/cc7fmHWRjMHZZJNsfuKgoazeBEK.jpg","/163BqvdIEsecNJPmTxaU9fhIFMc.jpg","/aIEtHce6MDC3oMO3o0rzy0F5PGk.jpg"]}